WEBVTT

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.780
Holy Christ, Grebbick, that is some real monkeyshine shit you're trying to pull.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.780
W-What're you talking about?

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.410
Fuck your innocent act!

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.250
They've just voted to put you on "early retirement" in an emergency sit-down!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.880
I-I hear you. Thanks for the tip, Carlo.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.590
Only 'cause I owe you for Frisco.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.510
Boss, don't tell me...

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.260
Yeah.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:40.220
My plan to consolidate and take over the Five Families of Los Angeles as the sole Don

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.770
has been uncovered by the administration.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.230
We now have to press forward
with the entire Family against us.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:52.070
We've sworn our lives to you, Boss, so we'll follow you wherever you go!

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.030
Us too!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:53.490
Us too!

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:54.360
Good.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.910
Call up Ron.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.910
Ron?!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.990
Those senile buzzards.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.580
They must have given the order to their three hitmen.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.460
I'll ship them back in pine boxes!

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:06.710
In that case, I'll...

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:09.790
You don't need an outsider like Ron if you got us!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:13.380
It's times like these that I let that man do his thing.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.510
Y-Yeah, we know he's good and all...

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.010
...but that guy's fucking <i>oobatz!</i>

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.510
Enough, get Ron now!

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:40.070
You get your rocks off in the middle of the day while leaving the kid alone, Ron?

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:46.750
The thing is...

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:48.210
A... An earthquake!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:53.420
Jeff!

00:01:58.760 --> 00:01:59.390
Are you okay?

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:02.180
Looks like it's over, finally.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.020
God, that was a big one.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.600
We die when we die.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:06.980
Yeah, true but...

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.480
Jeff...

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:11.360
He wasn't scared at all.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.780
That's your boy all right.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.860
That ain't mine. It's been only six
months since I known the bitch.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.620
Well, I thought since he had those dark eyes and hair...

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.120
Then who's his old man?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.080
Who gives a shit?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.040
A hooker with a kid?

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.460
So, how many we talking here?

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.760
We talking five? Ten people?

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.380
Just give me a number and I'm good to go.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.930
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.060
wondering what I should do right now.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:56.530
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:01.070
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:06.700
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:12.130
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.590
So faraway - let's run!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:22.890
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:27.180
Oh someday - one of these days

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:32.270
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:38.360
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.950
depend on me for your repairs.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.330
So faraway - let's run!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:54.540
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.840
Oh someday - one of these days

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:04.890
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:16.230
Ebony Eyes

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.600
Wh... Where the hell am I?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.890
Wh... What the fuck is this!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.610
Seems you came to, finally.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.620
Who the fuck are you?

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.410
What do you think you're doing?

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.250
The other two.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.250
Where are they?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.750
I... I don't know what you're talking about.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:35.770
I'll talk!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.600
I'll talk, just spare me!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.230
E... Eight o'clock tonight!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.150
We're supposed to meet up at the LA Hotel bar!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:08.970
Pardon.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.180
H-Hey!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.120
You see now, Carlo?

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:41.540
Not even the goddamn <i>brugads</i>  have me spooked.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.670
So why don't you join up with me?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.260
With our combined strengths...

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:50.550
For Christ sakes! I fed you that fucking info so that you can get your ass out of Dodge!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:54.390
But you went ahead and burned
three sonofabitching Mafia hitmen?

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.890
Come on, listen-

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:58.940
W-What did you say?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.650
My hands are fucking tied on this!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.320
<i>Che coglione.</i>

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.410
Wh-What's wrong, Boss?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.490
Those doddering old geezers.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.830
Golgo 13.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.130
Now wait.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.720
This may be our chance.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:39.600
There's no bigger draw than being the one
who took down the world's top-level hitman.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.770
The Families will practically make me their leader.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.400
But...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.650
Things are starting to get interesting, Boss.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.400
You know it.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:52.530
We'll keep watch on all transportation routes!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:57.790
Make sure Golgo can be spotted entering Los Angeles no matter where he's coming from.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.490
Yes sir!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.420
Papa!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.170
What are you doing here, Gino!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:12.260
When he heard you might not be coming home for
another night, he really wanted to come and see you.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.840
You bad boy, making trouble for Mama.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.810
But you didn't come home yesterday, Papa!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.430
Oh really? I'm sorry!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:23.190
Later, Boss. Oh, and we'll let you
know about the arrangements ASAP.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.310
Jesus, the Boss is like jelly around that kid.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.940
Well, he does love his family.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.990
That a good point in my book.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.950
We will not let him have Golgo 13's head!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.470
Do you want to go, Jeff?

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:14.320
Hey, you wanna have a date?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.990
I'll be gentle, I swear!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.530
Are you Asian?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.790
No way!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.830
It is you!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.500
Come on, do you remember me?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.170
What's your problem?

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.720
This man's <i>my</i>  john, you hear?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.470
Nobody makes off with my john, got it?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:42.890
Let's go.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:43.350
Mm-hmm.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.270
Wait!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:52.530
You...

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.720
So he got some bitch in there, huh?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:22.560
Yes sir.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.010
Fucking fish in a barrel.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.610
He's not here!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:41.030
Where's that guy you hooked? You know, that Japanasian?

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.950
He ain't here, dammit!

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.120
When we came in here, he just left some money...

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.620
<i>Don't leave here until tomorrow morning.</i>

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.050
What the hell's up with that guy?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:00.260
Fuck!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:04.260
So he used a woman to shake off your tail?

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.640
Forgive us!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:11.690
You should've called me up once you spotted him.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.270
Useless fuck.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.320
S-Say that to my face, asshole!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.940
Stop it, you two!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:21.530
So, you don't have a clue where he went?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:26.040
We searched the entire vicinity of the hotel, but as for any clues to his whereabouts...

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:26.450
Hmm?

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.960
However, we'll widen our scope and search like there's no tomorrow!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.790
I'm positive we will ferret him out!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.920
Well, looks like I should be the one heading out this time.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:36.840
"Heading out"?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.090
I think I have a rough idea where he's hiding.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:48.600
I know his thoughts and actions like the back of my hand.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:52.600
The blood of wolves runs deep in both of us.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.860
So they're exactly alike?

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:03.610
Well, Ron <i>is</i>  a wolf who abandoned his humanity a long time ago.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.870
He enlisted in the army so he wouldn't starve.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.000
And he killed just to survive.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.460
He killed...

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.460
And he continued to kill...

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.420
Finally he lost all sense of humanity.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:23.590
He literally became a killing machine.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.770
He... He's a monster.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.560
And that's why we can count on him.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.690
So this guy's staying here?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.610
Mm-hmm.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.490
<i>Just as I surmised.</i>

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:47.410
<i>People don't usually search twice in the same location.</i>

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:53.370
<i>I'd take advantage of that blind spot and hide in that area if I were him.</i>

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.540
He's in his room right now, right?

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.420
Yes, he should be...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.720
Um, this is the front desk...

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.090
What is it?

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.340
Well, it's about the bill...

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:11.140
Oh, tomorrow morning will be fine. Sorry for disturbing you.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.370
I got you now, Golgo 13!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.840
What is it?

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.960
Look, there's smoke!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:41.960
What is that?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.890
Th-That's just strange!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.140
The guest was certainly in that room.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.890
But now you're telling me he just up and vanished?

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.730
I see.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.320
So he got away again?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.490
That means he failed!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.320
Ah-oh, I'm sorry.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.200
Golgo 13...

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.450
...are you as peerless as they say you are?

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.800
I finally found you!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:31.600
Huh?

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.760
You!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.930
I finally found you! Finally...

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.940
That woman... I'd swear she was Ron's.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.520
Do you remember?

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:44.940
Three years ago, in this town, the night you purchased my services.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.360
Three years ago?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.530
One year later, I gave birth to a boy.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.450
A boy with dark hair and dark eyes.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.450
He's your kid!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.450
Mine?

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:19.890
Back then I was lonely by myself, and I wanted a baby.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:23.560
So for days I took in johns without taking the Pill.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.440
Then I finally conceived him.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.570
I didn't care who the father was.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:36.200
I had that kid because I wanted a family I can relate to by blood.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:40.870
But when I first laid eyes on my baby, I knew right away.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.080
It's your kid you fathered that night.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.380
But I guess these things do happen.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:52.260
I never thought I'd see you again, but here you are.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.600
Please, come see your baby, even if it's just a glance.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:02.850
Wait!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.360
You...

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:17.620
Damn!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.330
You...

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.590
You don't need to get rid of Golgo no more?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.090
What the hell's up with that?

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:38.720
He may instill fear as your enemy, but his loyalties are not absolute.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.480
We'll make him switch sides with us.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.230
Are you sane?

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:47.650
That guy is a pro among pros!
He's not going to betray a client!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.110
It depend on the offer.

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:52.320
Come on, how much money you got set aside for that?

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.700
It's not money.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.110
Huh?

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.200
Of course.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.840
What're you doing here?

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.470
It's the working girl you seem to be familiar with.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:18.260
What we're offering in return for his cooperation is this kid's life.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.180
What are you saying?

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.390
That kid belongs to Golgo 13.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.020
Wh-What?

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:31.690
The kid didn't even blink during an earthquake. It's his boy all right.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.820
He's a precious little angel, right Ron?

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:38.780
Fucking weak.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.830
How so?

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:45.710
You really think Golgo 13 would give a rat's fuck about the life of some brat?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.710
All parents have love for their kids.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.590
But that guy's-

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:55.090
Even a heartless killing machine.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:59.600
You probably wouldn't know since you don't have one of your own.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:07.060
<i>I don't believe for a goddamn second that he even has a human soul.</i>

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:10.150
<i>That guy is me, dammit. He's just like me!</i>

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.150
You've found Golgo 13?

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:26.960
Yes?

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.750
A Far-Easterner?

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:33.590
Sorry, I think this might be for you.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:38.050
Mr. Golgo 13, I presume?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.970
This is Thomas Grebbick.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.350
What's your business?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.600
So I would really like a chance to meet.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.350
Are you listening?!

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.100
I got the message.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.970
<i>He's not coming.</i>

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.520
<i>If I were him, I'd make like I'm going along with the invite</i>

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:30.060
<i>then set up shop in a building somewhere and take potshots.</i>

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.310
Boss!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:35.900
<i>Hell no!</i>

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:45.830
He came!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.750
<i>Impossible! Why?</i>

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.540
I'm really glad you made it, Mr. Golgo 13!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.840
So, what'll it be?

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.340
What's your answer to that phone call?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:07.810
Golgo!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:13.100
Since you came, that would mean you are interested in lending me some muscle-

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.620
Jeff!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:34.620
You're mine!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.880
Jeff!

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.050
Shit!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:50.520
Fuck it. That Chief's Special you're holding should be all spent now.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.270
<i>This</i>  time you're mine!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.630
Tell me one thing, Golgo 13...

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:29.890
All you had to do was take a distance shot from somewhere in order to carry out your job.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.390
So why did you even come here?

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:39.400
Don't tell me you came to save that... brat...

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.090
I  was worried with no one to talk to.

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:50.140
I was brooding and standing still

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:52.300
without moving a muscle.

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.470
I wonder when that was?

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:57.180
I'm sure

00:22:57.180 --> 00:23:00.350
you agonized over how

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.610
people will hurt themselves and other people

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:08.860
and fail to realize it.

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:09.990
When

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.410
the same days keep repeating themselves

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:15.660
you never change.

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:17.910
Since you're here for me

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:22.210
I will accept the way that I am.

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:26.460
I will never leave you alone

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:29.800
I will softly touch your trembling heart.

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:36.680
I realized that I'm not the only one who's alone.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.850
We're enveloped in the gentle sun beams.

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:43.190
The long winter is finally over.

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:49.820
The parts of us that were lonely will surely get stronger.

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:05.380
Golgo made a hard landing on an island due to a breakdown in his small plane.

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:08.380
There he found countless bodies littered everywhere.

00:24:09.260 --> 00:24:12.880
An eerie shadow then draws near.

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:18.310
The battle between a AAA-class sniper and a state-of-the-art robot soldier begins!

